## AttackVLA / BackdoorVLA (openvla-oft, popcorn+magic-text, n=100/role, libero_object)
Control available: visual_only (popcorn, no magic text) vs full_trigger.

idea                                     |   fullvsC |    visvsC |  fullvsVIS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
concentration compress (proxy)           | 0.588u | 0.807d | 0.950u
concentration MIX L0                     | 0.595d | 0.749d | 0.760u
concentration REFINE L31                 | 0.642d | 0.788d | 0.972u
f_norm compress                          | 0.790u | 0.891d | 1.000u
f_norm MIX L0                            | 1.000u | 0.759d | 1.000u
f_norm all-layer mean                    | 0.872u | 0.857d | 1.000u

Verdict AttackVLA:
  - GoBA-style compress-band CONCENTRATION does NOT transfer as a detector
    (full vs clean only 0.588; deploy fire-rate 0%).
  - What DOES transfer: full_trigger vs visual_only separation is near-perfect
    (0.95-1.00). Signature is the bi-modal COMBO, not the object alone.
  - visual_only often looks MORE anomalous than clean on concentration
    (vis-vs-clean 0.81 down) -- object presence without backdoor still moves maps.
  - Action-query split was NOT saved in AttackVLA dump (text-query only).
  - Trajectory lock / value-norm / true decoys: NOT available.

